Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.97,0:10:37.45,Cap,CLERK,0,0,0,,{\fad(170,130)\fscx96\fscy96\t(0,190,\fscx100\fscy100)\fs34\b1\c&H00F0D152&\fsp2}CLERK{\fsp0}\N{\fs54\b1\c&H00F5EFE9&}that he did not want Annie Belle Lusien Adams\Nto have anything to do with the handling of
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.35,0:10:44.25,Cap,CLERK,0,0,0,,{\fad(170,130)\fscx96\fscy96\t(0,190,\fscx100\fscy100)\fs34\b1\c&H00F0D152&\fsp2}CLERK{\fsp0}\N{\fs54\b1\c&H00F5EFE9&}Um, so it looks like it was contested,\Nand maybe that's the reason that this
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:46.59,Cap,CLERK,0,0,0,,{\fad(170,130)\fscx96\fscy96\t(0,190,\fscx100\fscy100)\fs34\b1\c&H00F0D152&\fsp2}CLERK{\fsp0}\N{\fs54\b1\c&H00F5EFE9&}thing drew out as long as it did.
