Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.25,0:10:57.41,Cap,CLERK,0,0,0,,{\fad(170,130)\fscx96\fscy96\t(0,190,\fscx100\fscy100)\fs34\b1\c&H00F0D152&\fsp2}CLERK{\fsp0}\N{\fs54\b1\c&H00F5EFE9&}So, um, now look, here's the bonus for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.51,0:11:00.25,Cap,CLERK,0,0,0,,{\fad(170,130)\fscx96\fscy96\t(0,190,\fscx100\fscy100)\fs34\b1\c&H00F0D152&\fsp2}CLERK{\fsp0}\N{\fs54\b1\c&H00F5EFE9&}You make it out to that really nice\Nweather you got out there in Utah,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.29,0:11:04.14,Cap,CLERK,0,0,0,,{\fad(170,130)\fscx96\fscy96\t(0,190,\fscx100\fscy100)\fs34\b1\c&H00F0D152&\fsp2}CLERK{\fsp0}\N{\fs54\b1\c&H00F5EFE9&}and come here where it's about\Nninety-nine or a hundred degrees-
