Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.51,0:11:10.69,Cap,CLERK,0,0,0,,{\fad(170,130)\fscx96\fscy96\t(0,190,\fscx100\fscy100)\fs34\b1\c&H00F0D152&\fsp2}CLERK{\fsp0}\N{\fs54\b1\c&H00F5EFE9&}... to your heart's content.
