Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.01,0:11:15.91,Cap,CLERK,0,0,0,,{\fad(170,130)\fscx96\fscy96\t(0,190,\fscx100\fscy100)\fs34\b1\c&H00F0D152&\fsp2}CLERK{\fsp0}\N{\fs54\b1\c&H00F5EFE9&}All right, man. Well, listen,\Ngood luck to you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.95,0:11:16.97,Cap,RESEARCHER,0,0,0,,{\fad(170,130)\fscx96\fscy96\t(0,190,\fscx100\fscy100)\fs34\b1\c&H004DB8FF&\fsp2}RESEARCHER{\fsp0}\N{\fs54\b1\c&H00F5EFE9&}All right. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.01,0:11:18.03,Cap,CLERK,0,0,0,,{\fad(170,130)\fscx96\fscy96\t(0,190,\fscx100\fscy100)\fs34\b1\c&H00F0D152&\fsp2}CLERK{\fsp0}\N{\fs54\b1\c&H00F5EFE9&}Take care of yourself. All right. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:19.22,Cap,RESEARCHER,0,0,0,,{\fad(170,130)\fscx96\fscy96\t(0,190,\fscx100\fscy100)\fs34\b1\c&H004DB8FF&\fsp2}RESEARCHER{\fsp0}\N{\fs54\b1\c&H00F5EFE9&}All right. You too. Bye.
